38,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Jonathan, the variance is severe. February is nearly triple August. I also found the metering quote: 34,000 yen per room, plus annual checks. That is a significant upfront cost.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
